### What I Built

**`ingest.py`** — A complete data ingestion pipeline with:

| Feature | Detail |
|---------|--------|
| **Input formats** | CSV and Excel (.xlsx) |
| **Student ingestion** | Maps to `School → SchoolClass → Student` hierarchy |
| **Content ingestion** | Maps to Content model (video/quiz/exercise/reading) |
| **Validation** | Checks required columns, clamps out-of-range values, cleans messy data |
| **Modes** | `--validate-only`, `--dry-run`, live ingestion |
| **Grade history** | Parses semicolon-separated scores per topic |
| **Multi-school** | Creates schools/classes on the fly from CSV data |

**`sample_data/`** — Ready for Mia's UI testing:
- `sample_students.csv` — 5 Nigerian students across 2 schools (LAGOS MODEL SCHOOL, ABUJA PREP ACADEMY)
- `sample_content.csv` — 8 content items covering Math, Science, English, History

### Usage

```bash
# Validate only
python3 ingest.py --validate-only --students students.csv --content content.csv

# Generate sample data
python3 ingest.py --output-sample sample_data

# Live ingestion
python3 ingest.py --students students.csv --content content.csv --school "MY SCHOOL"
```

